.png", "id": "4433944633598660", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_4433944640265326_3429261202004879698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KAQkZ0GeaEIQ7kNvwGJT6Q_&_nc_oc=AdqYuR0yEdh235zNteG6uEiWkdxczCkmF1PtoGEcjKQ4XPirpDjcftP6hzqWI0FB0HM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHj6jBwrB-xVHKV7SQqUxfQb5JkK2FSwu2XcJq-VGmo-g&oe=6A92AF41"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00003 2.png", "id": "1358136499494641", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_1358136502827974_9023638638628557428_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mFzAA6kiIuYQ7kNvwGUxtbm&_nc_oc=AdrombSlXZ_HCwnB0xkieePKGbg3k3Ua2IExxPHuKG-jOC7wEQJad3g0HMeWuOl4mHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF2TgZ67Lmkc_3Q4WAKtBw2CAlGxa6LYSsWya_Pd8nTKQ&oe=6A92B88B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Life V-aiR - Serious Game", "keywords": ["AirQuality", "Environment", "SeriousGame", "Puzzle", "cooperation"], "long_description": "# \u26a0\ufe0f READ BEFORE YOU PLAY \u26a0\ufe0f\nThis game is a training tool used by the Life V-aiR project partners to raise decision makers awareness about air quality issues. \nIt is supposed to be played in cooperation with a player outside the headset using a \"Technical Manual\".\nIf you're interested in playing, please contact the developer of the game ! \n# How to play\nIf you already know the concept of the game, please download the Technical Manual on this page : \nhttps://tinyurl.com/LifeVaiRTechnicalManuals\n\n# Project maintainer \nPlease for any informations on how to play or to deploy it on your territory, contact the maintainer of the game here : \nhttps://tinyurl.com/LifeVairContact", "short_description": "Life V-aiR is a serious game developed to raise awareness of people about air quality issues\nA external document is required to play the game as intended."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id":